{"type":"after","callId":"call@38","endTime":48921.478,"result":{"snapshot":"- generic [active] [ref=f1e1]:\n  - main [ref=f1e2]:\n    - generic [ref=f1e3]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e4]:\n        - link \"WalletGenome home\" [ref=f1e5] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /\n          - generic [ref=f1e6]: WALLET.GENOME\n        - button \"Open navigation\" [ref=f1e7] [cursor=pointer]\n      - 'status \"Indexing status: Ready\" [ref=f1e10]':\n        - generic [ref=f1e12]: Ready\n    - region [ref=f1e13]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e14]: Multi-chain behavioral forensics\n      - heading \"Investigate observable activity across supported EVM networks\" [level=1] [ref=f1e18]\n      - paragraph [ref=f1e19]: Review observable on-chain behavior, capital flows, available public identities, and security signals across Ethereum, Base, Arbitrum, and Optimism.\n    - region \"Wallet Forensics Console\" [ref=f1e20]:\n      - tablist \"Forensics Scan Mode\" [ref=f1e21]:\n        - tab \"Single wallet\" [selected] [ref=f1e22] [cursor=pointer]\n        - tab \"Cluster scan\" [ref=f1e27] [cursor=pointer]\n      - tabpanel \"Single wallet\" [ref=f1e33]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e35]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e36]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e37]: Wallet address or ENS domain\n            - textbox \"EVM address or ENS domain\" [ref=f1e42]:\n              - /placeholder: Enter EVM address (0x...) or ENS name (vitalik.eth)\n          - group \"Select target EVM networks\" [ref=f1e43]:\n            - button \"Toggle Ethereum network\" [pressed] [ref=f1e44] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e46]: ETH\n            - button \"Toggle Base network\" [pressed] [ref=f1e47] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e49]: BASE\n            - button \"Toggle Arbitrum network\" [pressed] [ref=f1e50] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e52]: ARB\n            - button \"Toggle Optimism network\" [pressed] [ref=f1e53] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e55]: OP\n            - button \"Scan wallet address\" [ref=f1e56] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e57]: SCAN\n    - generic [ref=f1e60]:\n      - region [ref=f1e61]:\n        - heading \"Explore saved demo wallets\" [level=2] [ref=f1e63]\n        - generic [ref=f1e67]:\n          - button \"Load saved demo snapshot for Vitalik Buterin\" [ref=f1e68] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e69]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e70]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e71]: Co-founder of Ethereum\n                - generic [ref=f1e72]: Saved · non-live\n              - generic [ref=f1e73]: vitalik.eth\n              - generic [ref=f1e74]: Saved public EVM data for Vitalik Buterin across four supported networks. The dashboard keeps the original provider and pricing completeness warnings.\n            - generic [ref=f1e75]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e76]: Four supported EVM networks · Updated Aug 26, 2026\n              - generic [ref=f1e77]: Open\n          - button \"Load saved demo snapshot for Hayden Adams\" [ref=f1e81] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e82]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e83]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e84]: Founder of Uniswap\n                - generic [ref=f1e85]: Saved · non-live\n              - generic [ref=f1e86]: hayden.eth\n              - generic [ref=f1e87]: Saved public EVM data for Hayden Adams across four supported networks. The dashboard keeps the original provider and pricing completeness warnings.\n            - generic [ref=f1e88]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e89]: Four supported EVM networks · Updated Aug 25, 2026\n              - generic [ref=f1e90]: Open\n          - button \"Load saved demo snapshot for Anthony Sassano\" [ref=f1e94] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e95]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e96]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e97]: Founder of The Daily Gwei\n                - generic [ref=f1e98]: Saved · non-live\n              - generic [ref=f1e99]: sassal.eth\n              - generic [ref=f1e100]: Saved public EVM data for Anthony Sassano across four supported networks. The dashboard keeps the original provider and pricing completeness warnings.\n            - generic [ref=f1e101]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e102]: Four supported EVM networks · Updated Aug 25, 2026\n              - generic [ref=f1e103]: Open\n          - button \"Load saved demo snapshot for Richerd Chan\" [ref=f1e107] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e108]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e109]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e110]: Co-founder of Manifold\n                - generic [ref=f1e111]: Saved · non-live\n              - generic [ref=f1e112]: richerd.eth\n              - generic [ref=f1e113]: Saved public EVM data for Richerd Chan across four supported networks. The dashboard keeps the original provider and pricing completeness warnings.\n            - generic [ref=f1e114]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e115]: Four supported EVM networks · Updated Aug 25, 2026\n              - generic [ref=f1e116]: Open\n      - region [ref=f1e120]:\n        - heading \"HOW DOES WALLETGENOME WORK?\" [level=2] [ref=f1e121]\n        - generic [ref=f1e126]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e127]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e128]: \"01\"\n            - heading \"Multi-Chain Scan\" [level=3] [ref=f1e129]\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e130]: Enter an EVM 0x address or ENS domain. We query Ethereum, Base, Arbitrum, and Optimism simultaneously—without requiring you to connect a wallet or install extensions.\n          - generic [ref=f1e131]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e132]: \"02\"\n            - heading \"Forensic Processing\" [level=3] [ref=f1e133]\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e134]: Our indexing engine filters out spoofed/scam meme tokens, verifies legitimate protocol contracts, audits 5 public Sybil databases, and resolves verified social profiles (Web3.bio).\n          - generic [ref=f1e135]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e136]: \"03\"\n            - heading \"Actionable Intelligence\" [level=3] [ref=f1e137]\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e138]: Synthesizes a 6-axis Behavioral Radar, assigns a quantified Persona archetype, renders an interactive money flow graph, and flags observed unlimited approval states.\n      - region [ref=f1e139]:\n        - heading \"WHAT THE SCANNER CAN INVESTIGATE\" [level=2] [ref=f1e140]\n        - generic [ref=f1e146]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e147]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e162]:\n              - heading \"Behavioral DNA & Personas\" [level=3] [ref=f1e163]\n              - text: Quantitative archetype classification\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e164]: Understand how an entity operates on-chain. Are they a DeFi Power User, Active Trader, or Passive Whale? Our engine computes 6 mathematical dimensions including contract breadth, maturity, and Shannon entropy.\n          - generic [ref=f1e165]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e173]:\n              - heading \"Interactive Capital Flow Topology\" [level=3] [ref=f1e174]\n              - text: Follow where the capital really travels\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e175]: \"Visualize inflows from exchanges, DeFi protocol interactions, and outbound destinations in an interactive particle-flow canvas. Automatically uncovers the #1 most-sent-to recipient wallet.\"\n          - generic [ref=f1e176]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e183]:\n              - heading \"Available Social Identity Links\" [level=3] [ref=f1e184]\n              - text: Available public profile context\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e185]: Shows available public Web2 and Web3 profile links from ENS, Farcaster Warpcast, Lens Protocol, Twitter/X, and GitHub.\n          - generic [ref=f1e186]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e192]:\n              - heading \"Security & Approval Audit\" [level=3] [ref=f1e193]\n              - text: Identify wallet vulnerabilities & blacklist status\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e194]: Protects assets by highlighting observed unlimited approval transactions to unverified contracts, calculating dead zero-liquidity tokens, and checking against LayerZero, Hop, and OFAC sanctions lists.\n      - generic [ref=f1e195]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e196]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e197]: ALGORITHMIC SPECIFICATION & MATHEMATICS\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e201]: Explore how we compute Shannon entropy, Trusta MEDIA Sybil scores, risk grade heuristics, and multi-chain gas valuations.\n        - link \"READ THE DOCS\" [ref=f1e202] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /docs\n      - generic [ref=f1e206]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e207]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e211]: \"100% Read-Only & Safe:\"\n          - generic [ref=f1e212]: We never ask for wallet signatures or private keys.\n        - generic [ref=f1e213]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e214]: \"Supported Networks:\"\n          - generic [ref=f1e215]: Ethereum · Arbitrum · Base · Optimism\n  - contentinfo [ref=f1e216]:\n    - generic [ref=f1e217]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e218]:\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e219]: WalletGenome\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e220]: Read-only, evidence-aware EVM wallet analytics. No wallet connection or signature required.\n      - navigation \"Wallet analytics topics\" [ref=f1e221]:\n        - link \"Methodology\" [ref=f1e222] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /docs\n        - link \"EVM Wallet Analytics\" [ref=f1e223] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /evm-wallet-analytics\n        - link \"Crypto Wallet Risk Checker\" [ref=f1e224] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /crypto-wallet-risk-checker\n        - link \"Token Approval Checker\" [ref=f1e225] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /token-approval-checker\n        - link \"Sybil Wallet Analysis\" [ref=f1e226] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /sybil-wallet-analysis\n        - link \"Multi-Chain Wallet Forensics\" [ref=f1e227] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /multi-chain-wallet-forensics\n  - alert [ref=